"text": "The gates run on the dev host, Linux. Nothing boots outside the harness: there is no live leg, and the real boot is /implement P3's. The base sha in the census entries is HEAD as this plan is written, `4f68f0d523aed2d6c3ef7e34ddccf2ca05c0506c`."
